     A                                      COLHDG('ZIPCODE 1')
     A            CTZIP2    R               REFFLD(ZIP2)
     A                                      COLHDG('ZIPCODE 2')
     A            CTCONT    R               REFFLD(NAME)
     A                                      COLHDG('CONTACT' 'NAME')
     A            CTTARA    R               REFFLD(ARCD)
     A                                      COLHDG('PHONE' 'AREA CODE')
